{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107002","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107002/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107002/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107002/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107002","id":3106060574,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6Ya_fU","number":107002,"title":"`GDScriptInstance`: use write pointer for `members`","user":{"login":"DeeJayLSP","id":60024671,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwMDI0Njcx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/60024671?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP","html_url":"https://github.com/DeeJayLSP","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","color":"aaccff","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098082,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgwODI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gdscript","name":"topic:gdscript","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":3240950060,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzMjQwOTUwMDYw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/performance","name":"performance","color":"447777","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":2,"created_at":"2025-05-31T21:33:24Z","updated_at":"2026-06-30T15:00:43Z","closed_at":"2026-06-30T13:50:29Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/107002","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107002","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107002.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107002.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"Supersedes #105555.\r\n\r\nAdds a `_members` variable in `GDScriptInstance`, which stores a single write pointer to `members`, and moves every write operation from `members` into it (notably the VM). This avoids a lot of unnecessary forks.\r\n\r\nThe `members` vector only ever reallocates in two places: instance creation (only once on non-debug) and script reloading (debug only). This makes the pointer safe to store.\r\n\r\nRunning production builds (`production=yes`) side-by-side on [Bunnymark](https://github.com/GaijinEntertainment/godot-das/tree/master/examples/bunnymark), I got the following averages:\r\n\r\n100 bunnies:\r\n| Branch      | FPS  |\r\n|-------------|------|\r\n| master      | 2822 |\r\n| PR          | 2820 |\r\n> 0.07% lower performance, too low to be considered a problem.\r\n---\r\n\r\n1000 bunnies:\r\n| Branch      | FPS       |\r\n|-------------|-----------|\r\n| master      | 1299-1310 |\r\n| PR          | 1302-1311 |\r\n> On my tests, it varies between 0.61% lower and 0.92% higher. Pretty much in the margin of error.\r\n---\r\n\r\n10000 bunnies:\r\n| Branch      | FPS     |\r\n|-------------|---------|\r\n| master      | 121-124 |\r\n| PR          | 126-133 |\r\n> Between 1.61% and 9.92% higher performance\r\n---\r\n\r\nThis is a less aggressive change compared to #105555 which improves performance while not having the same penalty with a low amount of instances.\r\n\r\nI tried to use the pointer on getters too, but performance was lower in the 1000 bunnies case.\r\n\r\nI also noticed this solution is used for `global_array` (which I partly mimicked for `members` in this PR) and in some parts of `GDScriptFunction`, so I think it's fair to do it here. Maybe it could also be used for `static_variables`?","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107002/reactions","total_count":5,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":5},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107002/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}